  "question": {
    "text": "The number of ways in which&nbsp;<math><mn>10</mn></math> boys can be divided into <math><mn>2</mn></math> groups of <math><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo></math> such that two tallest boys are in two different groups, is equal to"
